{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><figure><figcaption>瑞聲科技擬透過發行點心債融資。(資料圖片)</figcaption></figure><p>彭博引述消息人士報道，瑞聲科技(2018)考慮發行發行離岸人民幣債券，融資不超過32億元人民幣。 債券年期分別為5年及10年。這是瑞聲科技首次發行點心債。該公司目前有一隻美元債，存續規模為2.9億美元，將於2031年到期。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-12T09:20:09.894300+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":133,"images":0,"source":"am730","fallback":"none"},"published_at":"2026-10-12T08:13:36+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-12T09:17:44.939841+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-12T09:17:44.939841+00:00","content_hash":"c5cf11c59af2a9a6c655b6bae8c79f29df75c35af1221154e9d99db5ad0af235","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null}